# This directory holds the actual book text (raw OCR dump + manually
# proofread DOCX) used by the golden-file regression test.
#
# Per the project's data policy, scanned/OCR book content must never
# be committed to the repository. These files live here only for local
# development and CI runners that have them provisioned separately
# (e.g. mounted from private storage, or fetched by a setup script
# that is itself not part of this repo).
#
# tests/golden/test_manual_proofread_regression.py SKIPS (not fails)
# when these files are absent, so a fresh clone without them still
# passes the normal test suite.

*.txt
*.docx
!.gitkeep
